sequenceDiagram
    title UC02 大交通订单代表流程——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as FlightSearch.vue
    participant P2 as TrafficOrderController
    participant P3 as TrafficOrderServiceImpl
    participant P4 as FlightMapper
    participant P5 as TrafficOrderMapper
    P0->>P1: 选择航班与乘客
    P1->>P2: POST /api/order/flight/create
    P2->>P3: createFlightOrder()
    P3->>P4: 条件扣减座位
    P4-->>P3: 扣减成功/库存不足
    P3->>P5: 新增待支付订单
    P5-->>P3: 返回 orderNo
    P3-->>P2: 返回订单号
    Note over P0,P5: 此图仅为 UC02 代表流程；UC03、UC04、UC16 分别见图片 38、39、51。
